  "description": "Kang Il, who is a former Idol group L.I.P  \nwhen it reached the time of its popularity, the group L.I.P decided to disband.  \nTime passes, popularity fades, even Kang Il's marriage, with famous novelists not in the media's spotlight, they don't hide their marriage, it's just that the media doesn't pay attention to their lives, is this marriage still happy?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/50319878), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4443000914), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6452959), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bluehole_marriege), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Bluehole)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/7982), Russian",
